### Get root / 
GET http://localhost:8080

### Post root / - Method not allowed on root
POST http://localhost:8080

### Get About - Nonexistent route (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/about

### Post Test - Method not allowed on nonexistent route
POST http://localhost:8080/about

### Get (nonexistent route) - Should return 404
GET http://localhost:8080/test


### Users Create (GET) - Not allowed, creation must be via POST
Get http://localhost:8080/users/create    

### Users Create (POST) - Creates a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/users/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Marcelo10",
    "email": "marcelo10@mail.com",
    "password": "admin"
    //"role": ["admin", "mod", "user"]
} 

### Post Auth User - User login, returns JWT
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcelo10@mail.com",
    "password": "admin"
}

